// SMT Engine — GXV SMT (HTF Profiler port)
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// DATA -> RANGE -> SWEEP -> DIVERGENCE -> EVENT -> INVALIDATION -> PROJECTION
// 13 families (15m … 12M). Each family compares the current range with the previous
// range of the chart symbol and each pair; an SMT is live while the range develops and
// confirmed at rollover; a line whose path crosses a candle body is filtered (not 12M).
// Data: 2 chart-timeframe requests (one per pair): high, low, time, open, close.
// ============================================================================

